# SmolVLA isolated dependency closure.
# Regenerate: tools/lock_model.sh smolvla
#
# Why these exact versions:
# - lerobot 0.4.1 caps transformers<5.0.0 and requires num2words>=0.5.14.
# - transformers 4.x imports PIL.ImagePalette at module load time.
# - Pillow 11.3.0 stopped eagerly importing ImagePalette; 11.2.1 works.
#   => pin Pillow==11.2.1 (independent of the global Pillow==11.3.0 pin).

